        "description": "The Criterion Collection is a preeminent home video and streaming brand dedicated to gathering and publishing the most significant films from around the globe. Since 1984, it has been recognized for its rigorous commitment to high-quality restorations and the inclusion of extensive, scholarly supplemental material. By treating film as high art, it maintains a unique position as both an essential resource for cinephiles and an academic benchmark for film preservation. The brand serves a sophisticated global audience of filmmakers, students, and collectors through a curated library of both historic and contemporary cinema.",
