        },
        "short_description": "The Criterion Collection is a company that distributes classic and contemporary films on 4K, Blu-ray, DVD, and via its streaming service, the Criterion Channel, featuring curated movies with special features and documentaries.",
        "short_descriptions": [
          {
            "language": "de",
            "value": "Ein führender Herausgeber für essentielles klassisches und zeitgenössisches Kino, bekannt für hochwertige Restaurierungen und kuratierte filmische Begleitmaterialien."
          },
          {
            "language": "es",
            "value": "Un editor líder de cine clásico y contemporáneo esencial, famoso por sus restauraciones de alta calidad y su contenido educativo y curado para cinéfilos."
          },
          {
            "language": "fr",
            "value": "Un éditeur de premier plan de cinéma classique et contemporain essentiel, célèbre pour ses restaurations de haute qualité et son contenu éducatif et curé."
          },
          {
            "language": "en",
            "value": "A premier publisher of essential classic and contemporary cinema, celebrated for high-quality restorations and curated, supplemental film educational content."
          }
        ]
